                     <provenance type="#rejected"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_404">Norwich,
                        Norfolk, Benedictine cathedral priory of Holy Trinity</orgName> <p>This
                        attribution was rejected in the second edition of Medieval Libraries of
                        Great Britain (1964), which did not change in the Supplement (1987). The
                        corresponding Medieval Libraries of Great Britain index card records the
                        following context for the rejection: Leland, <title>Coll.</title>, IV, 28,
                        has extracts Ex historia de Meriadoco, from a Norwich manuscript. This is
                        the only extant manuscript, but it contains nothing to associate it with
